<title>USA: TABLE-Textron Inc Q2 net rises.</title>
<headline>TABLE-Textron Inc Q2 net rises.</headline>
<dateline>PROVIDENCE, R.I. 1997-07-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>SECOND QUARTER	  SIX MONTHS</p>
<p>				  June 28   June 29  June 28 June 29</p>
<p>				     1997     1996     1997    1996</p>
<p>Revenues			 $2,667   $2,384   $5,218  $4,598</p>
